OL,3,ABBC FM radio transmissions suspended in
OL,4,AAfghanistan
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfghanistan's Taliban government has
OL,7,Fsuspended the transmission of BBC
OL,8,Fbroadcasts from FM radio sites across
OL,9,Fthe country.
OL,11,FA Taliban government spokesman said the
OL,12,FBBC had been suspended because of
OL,13,F"repeated violations" but did not
OL,14,Felaborate.
OL,16,FThe BBC has been the only international
OL,17,Fnews organisation to broadcast inside
OL,18,FAfghanistan since two US outlets were
OL,19,Fbanned from operating in the country in
OL,20,F2022.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,180,160,200,105,0,100
