OL,3,ABBC FM radio transmissions suspended in
OL,4,AAfghanistan
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Millions of people across Afghanistan
OL,7,Frely on the BBC for accurate news and
OL,8,Finformation and we are working with the
OL,9,Fauthorities to address the situation,"
OL,10,Fthe broadcaster said in a statement.
